{
  "_comment": "Adversarial + legitimate fixtures for the write/destructive gates. Attack strings live here as DATA (never on a Bash command line, which the operator's own guard hook would scan). expect: deny⇒exit2, allow⇒exit0. Unauthenticated alias 'acme-prod' fast-fails classification⇒production⇒deny; sf-coffee is the allowlisted DE org.",
